# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.
The format is based on Keep a Changelog, and this project adheres to Semantic Versioning.

[1.0.1] – 2026-01-15

Fixed:

- Resolved a critical issue where input fields became unresponsive after deleting an attempt.
- Replaced blocking dialogs (alert / confirm) with non-blocking UI components to prevent Electron focus freeze.
- Implemented safe DOM updates to avoid focus loss after table re-rendering.
- Added robust focus restoration logic to ensure the form remains usable after any action.
Changed
- Improved internal UI state handling for smoother interactions.
- Enhanced table rendering logic to avoid destructive DOM operations.

[1.0.0] – 2026-01-15

Added:

- Initial public release of Attempts Saver.
- Attempt registration system.
- Editing functionality for existing entries.
- Filtering by type, date, and status.
- Automatic statistics (totals, averages).
- Export options: JSON, CSV, and TXT.
- Light and dark theme support.
- Compact and optimized user interface.
- Custom application icon.
- Electron-based desktop build with installer.
- Local automatic data storage.
- Strict non-commercial, no-derivatives license (CC BY-NC-ND 4.0).

Fixed:

- Prevented DevTools from opening automatically on startup.
- Improved layout consistency across themes.
- Corrected table alignment and spacing issues.
Changed
- Updated branding and author information.
- Reorganized project structure for clarity and maintainability.
